From 4729d70bbbd7186a87ee8e403b2250d031c16d8e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Alessandro Fontana <alessandro.fontana@pm.me>
Date: Fri, 25 Sep 2026 18:06:34 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 08/31] libcamera: software_isp: Drive the focus lens from the
 IPA

Pass the lens controls to the soft IPA and apply the lens positions it
emits. The lens is opened on the first move, once the sensor streams,
and closed when the ISP stops, before the sensor. The generated IPA
interface headers and proxy are updated to match soft.mojom.

Assisted-by: LLM
---
